Hello managers,

Orchid People has published an updated internal synthetic policy suite, effective 18 August 2026. The suite covers flexible work, equal opportunity, interview conflicts of interest, candidate data handling, and employee referrals.

What you need to do
- Review the manager acknowledgement and complete it through the approved internal workflow.
- Use the People Operations procedure guide when a policy question or exception arises.
- Escalate uncertain cases before acting; keep records limited to the minimum information needed.

The materials are internal operating guidance and do not provide legal advice. Please contact People Operations through the approved internal channel for process support.

